post.description:
Create a recurring payment consent record.
The administered_by_contact_id is automatically set from the current session.
A detailed note is created with payment method information for audit trail.

Request body should contain:
{
    "contact_id": "uuid",
    "payment_method_id": "uuid" or null
}

Returns:
{
    "success": true,
    "data": {
        "id": "uuid",
        "contact_id": "uuid",
        "payment_method_id": "uuid" or null,
        "administered_by_contact_id": "uuid" or null,
        "consent_timestamp": "ISO datetime string"
    }
}

Check if a recurring payment consent record exists for a payment method.

Request body should contain:
{
    "payment_method_id": "uuid"
}

Returns:
{
    "success": true,
    "data": {
        "consent_given": boolean,
        "consent_id": "uuid" or null
    }
}

Retrieves accounting recoveries summary data for a claim,
including claim-level, exposure-level recoveries and total recoveries.
This endpoint uses pagination to return the data.

Permissions
-----------
Requires read access to at least one of:
    - 'britecore/claims/exposures'
    - 'britecore/claims/accounting'
    - 'agent/claims'

Parameters
----------
claim_id : str
    The ID of the claim for which to retrieve recoveries data.
page : int, optional
    The page number for paginated exposures (default: 1).
page_size : int, optional
    The number of exposures per page (default: 100).

Returns
-------
dict
    {
        'claim_level_recoveries': {
            'reinsurance_summary': {
                'total_recovery_reserve': Decimal,
                'total_recovered': Decimal
            },
            'reinsurancelae_summary': { ... },
            'salvage_summary': { ... },
            'subrogation_summary': { ... }
        },
        'exposure_level_recoveries': [
            {
                'id': str,
                'claimant_name': str,
                'coverage_name': str,
                'loss_name': str,
                'recoveries': {
                    'reinsurance_summary': {
                        'total_recovery_reserve': Decimal,
                        'total_recovered': Decimal
                    },
                    'reinsurancelae_summary': { ... },
                }
                ...
            },
            ...
        ],
        'total_recoveries': {
            'reinsurance_summary': {
                'total_recovery_reserve': Decimal,
                'total_recovered': Decimal
            },
            'reinsurancelae_summary': { ... },
            'salvage_summary': { ... },
            'subrogation_summary': { ... }
        }
    }

